1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:00,720
Good morning.

2
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,420
This is Karen Holmes, Mr. Reid's secretary.

3
00:00:04,100 --> 00:00:11,620
I'm sorry to disturb you Mr. Stokes, but Mr. Reid just called from the airport to tell me that his plane has been delayed by fog.

4
00:00:12,220 --> 00:00:17,840
The airport anticipates that the fog will lift sufficiently by ten o'clock for planes to be able to take off.

5
00:00:18,245 --> 00:00:22,470
So there will be a delay of at least two hours in Mr. Reid's itinerary.

6
00:00:23,040 --> 00:00:26,040
He could well arrive in New York at one o'clock in the afternoon.

7
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:32,420
That would mean that he will miss lunch but should have no problem arriving in time for the afternoon meeting.

8
00:00:33,180 --> 00:00:35,980
I will call you back after ten to let you know the situation.

9
00:00:36,620 --> 00:00:39,700
Oh, and do you have a cell phone number on which you can be contacted?

10
00:00:40,420 --> 00:00:40,775
Thanks.

11
00:00:41,020 --> 00:00:42,620
I'll speak to you later, Mr. Stokes.
